WEBVTT

00:32:28.496 --> 00:32:31.538
silliest thing to me, it's
incredibly powerful.

00:32:31.579 --> 00:32:34.079
We had a magician in our office and
this was like two years ago,

00:32:34.079 --> 00:32:36.704
and he was in my office,
just the two of us.

00:32:36.704 --> 00:32:42.496
And he did a few tricks and he did
one that literally made me,

00:32:42.704 --> 00:32:51.913
as a 50 year old man, think to myself in
my head, he might be magical, like,

00:32:52.496 --> 00:32:54.204
you know, because I know how
magic tricks are done.

00:32:54.204 --> 00:32:56.663
I know how a lot of I know bunch of
gimmicks. I know a bunch of tricks.

00:32:57.538 --> 00:33:01.621
He did something where I was like,
I wonder if he's maybe magical.